   "locked": false,
   "text": "Each pass leaves more skills held, so the next path waives more and takes less time.\nA private LP is tracked and credited like any other; it issues course certificates and\nskill badges, but no programme certificate.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
