   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "A skill is held when a tagged course completes, when every question tagged with it is answered at full marks in the learner's best attempt, or when an\nexternal credential is imported. There are no levels and no cut-scores, so waiving is a set-subset test and the gap is a set difference.",
